; DT818_pro_v3 - 6-stream ORB rank portfolio + 6 REVERSE-hedge sub-streams
; 6.0% TOTAL RISK variant (1.0% x 6 streams). Lower-risk version of dt818_pro_v3_9pct_may16_may9.set.
; Generated 2026-05-16, hedge params refreshed 2026-05-17 (may16_may9 rotation, round 7 hedge WFO — final).
; Use with ea/DT818_pro_v3.mq5 (recompiled 2026-05-16 with _HEDGE_Sn_SLMult input + risk-equalized lots).
;
; PARENT total risk: 6.0% (1.0% x 6 streams). Range filter DISABLED.
;   S1-S3 = MAY9 R1-R3 (PREVIOUS-week WFO), magics 1111/2222/3333
;   S4-S6 = MAY16 R2/R3/R4 (CURRENT-week WFO, R1+R5 dedup-skipped), magics 4444/5555/6666
;
; REVERSE-HEDGE config (from wfo_hedge_reverse_may16/winner.json round 7):
;   Direction:    OPPOSITE of parent
;   Order type:   LIMIT at parent's original entry price
;   SL distance:  parent_SL_pts * sl_mult  (per-stream WFO winner)
;   TP distance:  parent_SL_pts * tp_mult  (per-stream WFO winner)
;   Lots:         parent_lots / sl_mult    (risk-equalized — hedge $-loss = parent $-loss)
;   Global expire_minutes = 240
;   Global F1 filter      = 1800s (30min cap)
;   Global regime_gate    = off
;   Hedge magics: 8111/8222/8333/8444/8555/8666 (v3 reverse).
;
; Round 5 sim (30pt friction, $10k, 1.0%/stream = 6.0% total) expected scale-down
; from 9pct numbers by ~0.5-0.6x NP, ~0.55x DD (sub-linear DD growth).
;
; Spread guard: _MaxSpreadPts=60

; ===== Global account =====
_CapitalProtectionAmount=0.0||0.0||1||0.0||0.0||N
